check 1
# C->S 0x14 overhead chat, injected with the layout the 1.14d client itself sends for '!hi'
# (recorded in net-chat-typed-ama): 14, u16 0, the text and its NUL, two more NULs: 8 bytes. The 7-byte
# form of gen-nets2c-overhead is dropped by 1.14d before dispatch. 1.14d answers S->C 0x26 (type 5) one
# frame later. Answers pc1-data.md Step 4 [rc-link-2].
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md, specs/tools/poke.md.
name net-overhead-inject-ama
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 300
channels packets
at 10 send hex 14 00 00 68 69 00 00 00
